---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Base title="About" description={SITE.tagline}>
  <div class="wrap">
  <header class="page-head"><h1>About</h1></header>
  <div class="prose">
    <figure class="about-portrait" role="img" aria-label="Portrait of Eric Mey against a dark background with amber signal lines"></figure>
    <p>I'm Senior Director, Emerging Technology and Innovation at SalesAi. I build voice and agent systems, measure how they behave, and turn what I learn into tools and guides other developers can use.</p>
    <p>I designed an AI software foundry that gives a team of AI systems a shared architecture and parallel development slices, then orchestrated its use to deliver SalesAi's Usage and Entitlement Platform, which now runs the company's usage and entitlement infrastructure.</p>
    <p>My work also includes evaluation and fine-tuning tooling, speech-model integration on GPUs, and the move from a white-label voice platform to an agent harness we own. I lead the AI Center of Practice and work directly on customer solutions as a solution architect. I teach engineers context engineering; a public version of that lesson is <a href="/articles/give-your-coding-agent-a-maintained-map">here</a>. The company systems are described here, not published as open source.</p>
    <p>My independent work is public. I published a <a href="/projects/five-lane-router">five-lane request router</a> with its model, dataset, evaluation and a <a href="https://huggingface.co/blog/ericmey/train-your-own-request-router">tutorial for training your own</a>. <a href="/projects/musubi">Musubi</a> stores and retrieves agent observations and context, with hybrid search and a path from raw captures to human-reviewed notes. A <a href="/projects/musubi-ecosystem">shared runtime and host integrations</a> bring that memory into coding agents.</p>
    <p>My engineering leadership includes product engineering at SalesAi and internal systems at Salesforce, where I managed the integration of Einstein AI into internal tools. I'm based in {SITE.location}. Outside work: guitar, sound design and custom music hardware. <a href={`mailto:${SITE.links.email}`}>Email me</a> or find me on <a href={SITE.links.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a>.</p>
  </div>
  </div>
</Base>
